From: QLI integration <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uefi-sec: use MinkCom for variable sync

Initialize Mink IPC through MinkCom, open UEFISecApp by UID, and invoke
syncVarTables through its Mink object interface. Generate the public
IClientEnv client binding from the BSD-3-Clause-Clear IDLs.

Upstream-Status: Pending [Not submitted upstream]

